{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_92_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"一、二十有九年，春，介葛盧來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_92_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"介，國也。葛盧，微國之君，未爵者也。其曰來，卑也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_92_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"二、公至自圍許。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_92_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月，公會王人、晉人、宋人、齊人、陳人、蔡人、秦人，盟於翟泉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_92_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"四、秋，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_92_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_92","textTraditional":"五、冬，介葛盧來。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}